\p{Note that we can finally use the [Division Algorithm](00DD) to tidy up our notions of even and odd. We defined Even as XXX and Odd as XXX.  Intuitively, we know that if a number is not even, then it has to be odd, and vice versa, but we haven't proved that until now.}

